    "id": "D5",
    "name": "Source Control and Git",
    "ascii": "SOURCE CONTROL AND GIT\n======================\n\nFile changes ------+\nExplicit refresh --+--> Repository ---- resource groups ----> ExtHostSCM\nGit operations ----+    |                                    |-- provider / group registration --+\n                        |                                    `-- resource splices ---------------+\n                        |                                                                        |\n                        |                                                                        v\n                        |                                                                  MainThreadSCM\n                        |                                                                        |\n                        |                                                                        v\n                        |                                                           MainThreadSCMProvider\n                        |                                                           |-- identity / root\n                        |                                                           |-- groups / resources\n                        |                                                           `-- change notifications\n                        |                                                                        |\n                        |                     SCMService.repositories -----+                     |\n                        |                     focus / selection -----------+---------------------+\n                        |                                                  |\n                        |                                                  v\n                        |                                              SCMViewPane\n                        |                                              |-- tree / list\n                        |                                              |-- decorations\n                        |                                              `-- resource actions\n                        |                                                  |             |\n                        |                      +------- Stage -------------+             |\n                        |                      |                                         |\n                        |                      v                                         |\n                        |              CommandCenter.stage                               |\n                        |                      |                                         |\n                        `-- Repository.add <---+                                         |\n                            `-- git add -> status refresh                                |\n                                `-- resource groups update again                         |\n                                                                                         |\n                  +----------------------------- Open Changes ---------------------------+\n                  |\n                  v\n          ResourceCommandResolver\n          |-- single file -> vscode.open\n          |-- conflict -> merge editor\n          `-- comparison -> vscode.diff [COMMAND] -> EditorService -> DiffEditorInput\n                                                                          |        |\n                                                               original URI        modified URI\n                                                                          |        |\n                                                                          +---+----+\n                                                                              |\n                                                                              v\n                                                               TextModelResolverService\n                                                               |-- reuse loaded document\n                                                               `-- resolve missing contents\n                                                                              |\n                                                                              v\n          GitFileSystemProvider <----- git: ------------------------------ FileService\n          |-- readonly revision contents                                      |\n          `-- Repository.buffer                 File-system provider <--------+ file:\n              `-- git show                      `-- working-file contents\n                  |                                 |\n                  +----------------+----------------+\n                                   |\n                                   v\n                           TextFileService\n                           `-- decode each resource\n                                   |\n                         +---------+---------+\n                         |                   |\n                         v                   v\n                 original TextModel   modified TextModel\n                         |                   |\n                         +---------+---------+\n                                   |\n                                   v\n                           TextDiffEditorModel ------> TextDiffEditor / DiffEditorWidget\n                           |-- original reference      |-- compare models\n                           `-- modified reference      |-- original code editor\n                                                       `-- modified code editor\n                                                           `-- editing / undo / save\n\n\n[URI]       Resource identity shared by SCM entries, providers, and document models.\n[COMMAND]   Shared command dispatch connects UI actions to handlers.\n",
